{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>One who leads astray</b> — from their path; perhaps they will stumble on an evil way." "<b>when he perverts it</b> — what he did to ensnare them, he himself will fall into." "<b>they will inherit good</b> — after the death of the one who led astray."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 28, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:25:13.289633461Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}